                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Otini kengwïn Wero Chi ompö ororyö kïmi nko malayken löwïr kïtöpö ngacharenyi nyo pö paytagh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtuyechini nyu pipö Punton tawunyi tökïtar chane le wölo törtoy mösöwontö kechir nko ngaror, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "törchini kechir ewunyi pö tagh, kïtörchï nekö ewunyi pö löt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï pöytoghintö pïchinö mi ewunyi pö tagh, ‘Apkana nyu cho kikusoyönok Paponyan! Apkana atacha pöyunöt nyo kikekïlwekwa kïngeta otini le towunöto ngwïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyochan sutate apaghanïkwa, kyamatanïn maral, okonanïkwa pögh, kyochan ton, atachanïkwa ompö kestonikwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyochan chïrut, olokwanïkwa sïro, kyochan chirate apkanakwa arosanïn, kyomitan chela arutochanïkwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokyini nyu pïchoni pö man pöytoghin lö, ‘Oyï nya, Echotyon ato kikïsïwecha nyi nko kömöy, kepaghacha nyi anta amatinyi maral kekoninyi pögh? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwoyï ato kikïsïwecha nyi le ton ketokocha nyi anta ichï chïrut akelokucha nyi sïro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwoyï ato kikïsïwecha nyi ichï chirat anta imitö chela akerutoghchicha nyi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokyini nyu pöytoghintonay chane lö, ‘Omwowokwa nyoman lö kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo kyoghchikwa akonga ompö werköcha chï mïnkech, kï kyaghwanïkwa!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
