        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Atolapay kïlenchï pïchinö mi ewu löt, ‘Apeghena wölo omitan cho kikechïpok, ape olïte mapa kokay nyo kikengotyï Onyöt nko malaykenichi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kyochan sutate omulanïkwa omisyö, kyamatanïn maral mokonanïkwanye pögh aghegh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyochan ton wölo kimatakanïkwanye, kyochan chïrut amelö kyokonanïkwa sïra alak, kyochan chirate akyomitan chela, wölo kimapkanakwanye arosanïn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokyini nyu chane nyinte lö, ‘Akwoyï nya Echotyon ato kikïsïwecha nyi nko kömöy anta amatïn maral anta ichï ton anta ichï chïrut anta chirate anta imi chela amelö kikingarakacha nyi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokyini nyu pöytoghinto chane lö, ‘Omwowokwa nyoman lö, le wölini kyataghakwa oghchinö ngalechoni akonga ompö monechï mïnkech, kï kyataghakwa oghwanïn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïrongöy nyu pïchoni kïpa nyarïlpa kokay, wölo petöy chinö pö man söpon pö kokay.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
